---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SleepCalculator from '../components/SleepCalculator.astro';

const pageTitle =
    'Sleep Time Calculator | Find the Best Bedtime for a Restful Sleep';
const pageDescription =
    'Use our Sleep Time Calculator to determine the best time to wake up or go to bed for a full, restful sleep based on sleep cycles.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
    <SleepCalculator />

    <div class="container seo-content">
        <h2>Welcome to our Sleep Time Calculator!</h2>
        <p>
            If you're tired of waking up feeling groggy or not well-rested, our
            tool is here to help. Understanding your sleep cycle is key to
            getting the restful sleep you need. Sleep cycles typically last
            around 90 minutes, and waking up at the end of one can make a huge
            difference in how you feel throughout the day.
        </p>

        <h2>What is a Sleep Cycle?</h2>
        <p>
            A sleep cycle is a natural progression of sleep stages, including
            light sleep, deep sleep, and REM sleep. On average, a complete cycle
            lasts about 90 minutes. Waking up at the end of a cycle, rather than
            in the middle, can make you feel more refreshed and energized.
        </p>

        <h2>How Does the Sleep Time Calculator Work?</h2>
        <p>
            Our Sleep Time Calculator helps you determine the ideal time to go
            to bed or wake up based on sleep cycles. Whether you want to know
            the best time to wake up in the morning or the optimal time to fall
            asleep at night, our tool has you covered.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>If you want to wake up feeling refreshed:</strong>
                Input your desired wake-up time, and we'll calculate the best bedtime
                based on sleep cycles.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>If you're planning your bedtime:</strong>
                Input when you're going to bed, and we'll suggest the best wake-up
                time to ensure you get the full benefits of your sleep cycles.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why is Sleep So Important?</h2>
        <p>
            Good sleep is essential for mental and physical health. Sleep helps
            your body recover, boosts memory, improves mood, and increases
            productivity. By optimizing your sleep schedule and waking up at the
            end of a sleep cycle, you can improve your quality of life.
        </p>

        <h2>How to Use the Sleep Time Calculator:</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>
                Choose whether you want to wake up at a specific time or plan
                your bedtime.
            </li>

            <li>Enter your target time.</li>

            <li>
                Our calculator will suggest the best time for you to go to bed
                or wake up, ensuring you feel rested and energized.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Sleep Tips for Better Rest:</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Aim for 7-9 hours of sleep each night to maximize health
                benefits.
            </li>

            <li>
                Try to go to bed and wake up at the same time every day, even on
                weekends.
            </li>

            <li>
                Create a relaxing bedtime routine to help your body wind down.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Maximize Your Sleep for a Healthier Life</h2>
        <p>
            Our Sleep Time Calculator is a simple yet powerful tool to help you
            optimize your sleep patterns. By waking up at the right time—at the
            end of a sleep cycle—you can feel more alert, improve your mood, and
            increase your productivity throughout the day.
        </p>

        <p>
            Try our Sleep Time Calculator today and start waking up feeling
            refreshed!
        </p>

        <h2>Want to Know If You’re Getting Enough Sleep?</h2>
        <p>
            Even if you go to bed at the right time, you might still be building
            up sleep debt without realizing it. Use our free <a
                href="/sleep-dept-calculator/">Sleep Debt Calculator</a
            > to see how your sleep adds up over the week — and get personalized
            tips to catch up on rest.
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
